        "created_at": "2016-02-02T17:45:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wonder if this is maybe a language issue--it's quite English-dependent, so perhaps continental game distributors are hesitant to carry it?</p><p>The base game sometimes goes out of stock at Greater than Games, but has generally been available. I think the most recent reprint was in the Fall. Of course for your game store to get it at a reasonable price it needs to go through a distributor.</p>",
